<title>UK: Wet Brent moves at firmer Aug +5 cts - trade.</title>
<headline>Wet Brent moves at firmer Aug +5 cts - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>A cargo of Brent Blend changed hands at a five cent premium to August Brent on Thursday, traders said.</p>
<p>The July 27-29 loader moved at eight cents above the level agreed on Wednesday for a cargo loading the same dates, they said.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7646</p>
</text>
